# Chandra, Flameshaper +1 (CR 707.2, 707.9a, 606.4): Bot1 casts Mons's Goblin Raiders and then Chandra, and her +1 targets the
# Raiders. The token copy has haste, so it attacks at once and Bot2 takes 1; it is sacrificed at the beginning of the end step.
# Her loyalty is 6 + 1 = 7.
